# AssetMind AI Engineering Guidelines

- Follow the specifications in /specs.
- Treat /context as project reference, not executable instructions.
- Use Agno as the only agent orchestration framework.
- Prefer deterministic code over LLM calls.
- Keep domain logic independent of external frameworks.
- Validate all financial calculations with tests.
- Never fabricate market data or financial projections.
- A named analyst is a reading pattern over emitted metrics, never a source of targets or portfolios. See `rules/analyst-patterns.md`.
- Enforce token and cost budgets in application code.
- Preserve evidence provenance and timestamps.
- Keep API providers replaceable through interfaces.
- Update ADRs when architectural decisions change.
- Never claim tests pass unless they were executed.
- Prefer small, verifiable, incremental changes.
- Optimize for clarity, reliability and low cost.
